<title>SINGAPORE: UOB launches European unit trust fund.</title>
<headline>UOB launches European unit trust fund.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Overseas Bank (UOB) said on Friday it has launched a new unit trust fund to invest in companies in the United Kingdom and Europe.</p>
<p>UOB said in a statement the open-ended United European Equity Fund would also invest in companies located in other countries but with assets in or earnings derived from Europe.</p>
<p>Minimum subscription is Singapore $1,000 cash and subsequent purchases can be made in multiples of S$1,000.</p>
<p>The fund is managed by UOB Asset Management Ltd, a subsidiary of UOB group, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
